{"root":"gerombol","ipa":"/ɡərombol/","core":"指聚集在一起，通常指人群或物体成群结队、聚集成团。","pos":["动词"],"scenes":["高频","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/ɡərombol/","zh":"聚集，成群","phrases":[{"t":"gerombol di jalan","zh":"在街上聚集"},{"t":"gerombol bersama teman","zh":"和朋友聚在一起"},{"t":"suka gerombol","zh":"喜欢成群结队"}],"examples":[{"t":"Anak-anak itu gerombol di depan sekolah.","zh":"那些孩子们在学校门口聚集。"},{"t":"Jangan suka gerombol tanpa tujuan yang jelas.","zh":"不要无目的地喜欢成群结队。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"gerombol","ipa":"/ɡərombol/","zh":"聚集","phrase":{"t":"gerombol orang","zh":"人群聚集"},"example":{"t":"Mereka gerombol di taman.","zh":"他们在公园里聚集。"}},{"w":"gerombolan","ipa":"/ɡərombolan/","zh":"群体，团伙","phrase":{"t":"gerombolan liar","zh":"非法团伙"},"example":{"t":"Polisi membubarkan gerombolan itu.","zh":"警察驱散了那个团伙。"}},{"w":"mengerombol","ipa":"/məŋərombol/","zh":"聚集在一起","phrase":{"t":"mengerombol di sudut","zh":"在角落聚集"},"example":{"t":"Burung-burung itu mengerombol di atas pohon.","zh":"鸟儿们聚集在树上。"}},{"w":"mengerombolkan","ipa":"/məŋərombolkan/","zh":"使聚集，把...聚在一起","phrase":{"t":"mengerombolkan massa","zh":"聚集群众"},"example":{"t":"Dia mengerombolkan teman-temannya untuk berdiskusi.","zh":"他把朋友们聚在一起讨论。"}}],"derSlugs":["gerombol","gerombolan","mengerombol","mengerombolkan"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-28T08:58:17.017Z","src":"base"}